{"3593000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abrez", "steam_appid": 3593000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abrez</strong> is a thrilling arcade game that tests your precision and speed. The principle is simple: shoot at colorful cans moving along a conveyor belt. Some cans increase your score, while others decrease it. By shooting at coins, you can fill your basket to buy special balls: single, triple, or explosive, capable of hitting multiple targets at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful: if too many pyramids or groups of cans reach the end of the conveyor without being hit, <strong>you immediately lose the current level</strong>! Each level lasts 3 minutes, requiring quick thinking, strategy, and sharp aim to achieve the highest scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can <strong>buy</strong> and <strong>sell</strong> their balls to better adapt to each situation and optimize their performance. For added convenience, pressing the <strong>space bar</strong> on the keyboard brings up an image displaying all the main keyboard shortcuts and compatible controller buttons to help you control your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, a <strong>leaderboard</strong> is automatically updated, showing each player's nickname, avatar, and best score. Challenge your friends, climb to the top of the rankings, and become the master of <strong>Abrez</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tip:</strong> If you have an explosive bomb at the start of a game, you can sell it at the shop for <strong>30 Hft</strong> and buy <strong>6 yellow bullets</strong> instead. Each yellow bullet costs <strong>5 Hft</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abrez</strong> is a thrilling arcade game that tests your precision and speed. The principle is simple: shoot at colorful cans moving along a conveyor belt. Some cans in